.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfvars
backend.tf

# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed for this root module. pavo-bootstrap-aws
# is a customer-applied root module distributed as a release artefact via the
# sync-bootstrap-mirror workflow. Committing the lock file ensures every customer
# `terraform init` against the same tag resolves identical provider versions —
# without it, provider selection can drift across "identical" tagged releases.
